  "system": {
    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>You create a 20-foot-radius Sphere of yellow, nauseating gas centered on a point within range. The cloud is Heavilyobscured. The cloud lingers in the air for the duration or until a strong wind (such as the one created by <em>Gust of Wind</em>) disperses it.</p><p>Each creature that starts its turn in the Sphere must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or have the Poisoned condition until the end of the current turn. While Poisoned in this way, the creature can't take an action or a Bonus Action.</p>",
